      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Closed by a duplicated feature request because \"it's a third-party asset with its own license\". https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/add-gogoloco-natively\n\nSpecifically, it's the restrictive [GoGo Systems License](https://teeth-fetch-gdl.craft.me/CxY701Ne9Ng5Ev/b/22309754-4C33-4C00-96D5-580A4BCC697A/GoGo-Systems-License).",
