  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-31T02:28:41.413Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I've noticed when it comes to avatar creation, creators either don't know how to add gogo loco or don't even bother to add gogo loco, so instead of leaving it to creators to add it, as it is a stable for many half-body users or desktop users. \n\nAdding it natively, much like the avatar scaling option was added, makes it much easier! And adding it to it's own sub-menu would be easier instead of adding it to the options menu where the avatar reset toggle is.\n\nAnd plus, a way or option to add more animations like dances, idles, poses, etc.",
